  (text "EEPROM (replaces AT24C256 module)\nU501 AT24C256C-SSHL-T (SOIC-8, LCSC C6482) is assembled by JLCPCB.\nI2C address 0x50 (A0 = A1 = A2 = GND). The firmware layout is fixed at 32 KB (EepromLayout.h), so fit a 24C256 or 24C512.\nWP: R501 10k pulls EE_WP low (writes enabled); bridging solder jumper JP501 ties WP to +3V3 and write-protects the chip.\nNo I2C pull-ups here (they are on esp32-core)."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "15eb228e-39b3-46dd-9dbb-4f205fc234a5")
  )
